  "definition": "School and Shop Additional Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-05-13",
  "historyNote": "#6577, eff 9-13-97 (from Bar 304.01); amd by #7323, eff 7-26-00; ss by #7555, eff 9-12-01); ss by #7555, eff 9-12-01; ss by #8655, eff 6-9-06; amd by #9455-B, eff 4-14-09; amd by #9652, eff 2-3-10; ss by #10412-B, eff 9-19-13; ss by #10653, eff 8-7-14; ss by #10808, eff 4-2-15; ss by #13205, eff 5-13-21",
